0800","kind":"announcement","title":"Waifu Train Is Taking Part in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We're pleased to announce that Waifu Train is taking part in Steam Next Fest, running from October 19 to 26. We invite you to discover the game and try the free demo!What's in the demo?In the demo, you'll meet Rika Takamine - a housewife who has decided to take a break from her everyday routine. Play through part of her story and try the game's core mechanics: talk to her, discover her preferences, and unlock new possibilities in animated interactive scenes. Add Waifu Train to your wishlist to f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:27:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000800-1845383656380276","game_id":"steam-5000800","kind":"announcement","title":"The Waifu Train Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The free Waifu Train demo is now available to download from the game's Steam page.In the demo, you'll meet Rika, a housewife who has embarked on a journey in search of new experiences. The demo includes part of her storyline and lets you try out the core mechanics for interacting with her.We'd love to hear your feedback and impressions in the Steam discussions. Your input will help us as we continue developing the game. Add Waifu Train to your wishlist to stay up to date and be notified when the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T08:20:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000800-1841579228662445","game_id":"steam-5000800","kind":"announcement","title":"Waifu Train Is on Steam!","summary":"Welcome aboard an unusual train, where every passenger has her own personality, desires, and secrets. Meet the girls, make decisions, develop your skills, and unlock increasingly explicit encounters.Among your future fellow passengers are a housewife tired of the daily routine, a famous pop idol hiding her true nature, a confident TV presenter, and an energetic tomboy. Each girl will have her own story, personality, outfits, and branching scenes shaped by your decisions.The journey won’t end aft","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T12:32:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5000800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5000800":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5000800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z"},"5269190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:55Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5000800","app_id":5000800,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:15Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"af11f4968ba9e44bb5202a81d81ceda251da69cfb86e1d646be51cf79e0cfd00","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"여자들은 가장 대담한 욕망을 이루기 위해 유혹의 열차표를 구매합니다. 승객들과 가까워지고 각자의 취향을 알아내며, 모든 행동에 생생한 